meta {
  name: Skills
}

docs {
  These requests use synthetic skill content. Set backend_url, api_key, secret_key,
  and workspace_id in a private Bruno environment. Never put credentials in this
  collection. To use a browser session instead, replace the API-key headers with
  Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}.

  Set skill_name and skill_id from Create skill or Push skill. Set version to an
  immutable version number. base_version is that number, or JSON null before the
  first publish. revision comes from Get draft. expected_version is the label's
  current version, or JSON null to require a new label. Set label explicitly before
  Set label or Remove label; moving production changes unpinned consumers.

  Import uses skills_zip_path pointing to a local synthetic ZIP. Run Preview import
  first, then copy the desired keys into selected_bundle_keys_json as a JSON array.
  Invalid bundles cannot publish. Acknowledge warnings only after reviewing them.

  Follow next_offset from Read file chunk until eof, concatenate text in order,
  and verify the complete UTF-8 SHA-256. Resolve defaults to production, with no
  fallback to latest. To check caching, repeat Resolve skill with If-None-Match set
  to its ETag. A matching immutable digest returns HTTP 304.

  Archive skill, Remove label and Discard draft mutate state. Run each request
  deliberately; this folder is not a safe unattended collection run.
}
